# 1.2: Evolve's timing (the idea Unholy Union's, Bunker's and Tessera's, our own code), HOME's ALGORITHM: now and then
# on a phrase's start, as before; or every 4, 8, 16 or 32 bars from the top, every time. Evolve 40 and under: none, as
# ever. Saved, global (as Tune)
wait 500
expect view 0
expect evbars 0
listen
turn ALGO 2
wait 200
expect evbars 2
said evolve every 8 bars
expect dirty 1
shot evolve8.png
# Skellig's Evolve, 40: nothing moves
bar 17
expect evolves 0
# Evolve up: a nudge on bar 24, on 32, none between
turn K2 100
wait 900
expect par5 100
bar 23
expect evolves 0
bar 25
expect evolves 1
expect evolvebar 24
bar 31
expect evolves 1
bar 33
expect evolves 2
expect evolvebar 32
# every 4: on 36, 40
turn ALGO -1
wait 200
expect evbars 1
said evolve every 4 bars
bar 41
expect evolves 4
expect evolvebar 40
# a detent past either end: no further
turn ALGO 9
wait 200
expect evbars 4
said evolve every 32 bars
wait 2500
shot evolve32.png
turn ALGO 1
wait 200
expect evbars 4
turn ALGO -2
wait 200
expect evbars 2
# Evolve back down to 40 and under: none
turn K2 -100
wait 900
expect par5 0
bar 57
expect evolves 4
# saved (SAVE held), and back after a reboot; the reader hears it with the page
press SAVE
wait 600
release SAVE
wait 40
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 300
expect evbars 2
tap ENV
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 0
said Aisling page, evolve every 8 bars: Filter Off, Evolve 0, Motion 40, Drift 16 bars
# back to now and then: off the rule
turn ALGO -5
wait 200
expect evbars 0
said evolve now and then
